      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "D6C2708EEA434A25",
      "text": "Yup, that’s me!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "D6C2698EEA433E40",
      "text": "Prepare to be raided!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_05",
      "hash64": "8FC7CA649BB09638",
      "text": "I knew it!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "FE3FECE5CC9BE88D",
      "text": "Hoo-boy, this ain’t good![VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "FE3FDDE5CC9BCF10",
      "text": "Everyone else in the base is still asleep since we\\nwere up all last night playing video games...[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_06",
      "hash64": "8FC7CD649BB09B51",
      "text": "Leave h[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]imer to me, Mr. Grunt! I’ll buy some time\\nfor you to go wake up the others!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "FE3FDEE5CC9BD0C3",
      "text": "Yeah? And what’s in it for you?[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_07",
      "hash64": "8FC7CC649BB0999E",
      "text": "Don Atticus will be in danger if no one’s here to\\ndefend the base!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_08",
      "hash64": "8FC7C7649BB0911F",
      "text": "I owe that man my life. He’s my dear compadre!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_09",
      "hash64": "8FC7C6649BB08F6C",
      "text": "And when crisis calls, one has no choice but to\\nrally to those dear to him—no matter the cost!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_10",
      "hash64": "FE42EBE5CC9E1CB1",
      "text": "Yeah, I have no idea what you’re on about, kid.\\nBut thanks for the big assist![VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_10",
      "hash64": "8FC449649BAD852E",
      "text": "All right, you villain! If you’re after Don Atticus,\\nbe prepared to face my wrath!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_05",
      "hash64": "D6C26A8EEA433FF3",
      "text": "Bring it on",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_06",
      "hash64": "D6C26B8EEA4341A6",
      "text": "Wait a sec!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_11",
      "hash64": "8FC44A649BAD86E1",
      "text": "Discretion is the better part of valor, as the\\nsaying goes. Wise choice!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_12",
      "hash64": "8FC447649BAD81C8",
      "text": "YAAAAAAH!!!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_13",
      "hash64": "8FC448649BAD837B",
      "text": "Don Atticus...I’m sorry I failed you...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "5F2032885202D340",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Are you all right?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "5F2035885202D859",
      "text": "I was standing watch when I heard a ruckus all of\\na sudden.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "5F2034885202D6A6",
      "text": "I got worried that maybe something had\\nhappened to you over here...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_14",
      "hash64": "8FC44D649BAD8BFA",
      "text": "Argh... No fair! You had backup this whole time!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "5F2037885202DBBF",
      "text": "Is this boy one of the academy’s students?\\nHe doesn’t look like he’s from Team Star...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_15",
      "hash64": "8FC44E649BAD8DAD",
      "text": "You’re right—I’m not a member of Team Star...\\nbut Don Atticus is my compadre!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_16",
      "hash64": "8FC44B649BAD8894",
      "text": "I have to see him no matter what!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "5F2036885202DA0C",
      "text": "Well, clearly you have your reasons for\\nbeing here.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "5F2039885202DF25",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)]... I’d like to ask this\\nboy\\r\\nsome\\r\\nquestions.\\r\\nYou\\r\\ngo\\r\\nahead\\r\\nand\\r\\nget\\r\\nstarted\\r\\non\\r\\nthe base.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
